# Agent router (sync with AGENTS.md)

Source: `AGENTS.md` — run `pnpm sync:agents` after editing.

## Read order

`DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md` → `PROJECT_STATE.md` → `PROJECT_BACKLOG.md` → `ENGINEERING_PROTOCOL.md` → `GOVERNANCE_CHECKLIST.md`

## Executable governance

- Every session: complete `docs/03-development/GOVERNANCE_CHECKLIST.md`
- Before commit: `pnpm verify`
- Before PR: fill `.github/pull_request_template.md`; CI runs `governance.yml`
- Local governance check: `pnpm governance:validate:local`

## CI blocks PRs when

- `pnpm verify` fails
- PR template incomplete (Risk, DoR, DoD, ADR, Rollback, Evidence)
- CHANGELOG missing on code changes
- ADR reference missing on architecture changes
- ADR index / ADR-0001 violations

## Hard rules

No WordPress. No invented APIs/config. Governance before generation (§59). Append-only history.

Full protocol: `docs/03-development/ENGINEERING_PROTOCOL.md`
